  "description": "Guyanese Pepperpot is a dish from Guyana featuring beef chuck, yellow onion, garlic, thyme. This home-sized recipe records each ingredient at the step where it is used. Cassareep, the defining bitter-cassava reduction, is absent. Tamarind and molasses are NOT equivalent; this is pepperpot-inspired beef stew only.",
